Experiment with different types of cheese like shredded cheese or garlic cheese curds 🧀\\n• Adjust the size of the meatballs for personal preference, larger for subs or smaller for bite-sized portions 🍔\\n• Try using different types of meat like ground turkey, all beef, or all pork 🦃🐄🐖', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Pasta', 'slug': 'pasta'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 195, 'total_time_tier': None, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 48, 'count_positive': 1654, 'score': 0.9717978848413631}, 'video_ad_content': 'undetermined', 'video_id': 20620, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/35556/low_1498683294.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings'}, {'approved_at': 1495288638, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:1061', 'compilations': [], 'cook_time_minutes': 60, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1494537699, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Joey Firoben', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'Swap out traditional pasta for spaghetti squash in this classic dish, featuring tender turkey meatballs and a rich tomato sauce.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1061, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Use a fork to pierce holes down the side of the spaghetti squash. Microwave for 5 minutes.', 'end_time': 4000, 'id': 7864, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 2000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 7863, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 400}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'When the squash is cool enough to touch (5-10 minutes), slice the squash open, length-wise, with a sharp knife.', 'end_time': 8167, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 60, 'id': 6, 'match': 'slice', 'start_index': 56}], 'id': 7865, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 5000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Scoop out the seeds and drizzle the squash with oil. Season with salt and pepper.', 'end_time': 18000, 'id': 7866, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 9000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roast the squash cut-side down for 40 minutes, until easily pierced with a knife.', 'end_time': 21000, 'id': 7867, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 19000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl, gently mix together the ground turkey, onion, parsley, parmesan cheese, salt, and pepper. Form meatballs, and transfer to a greased baking sheet.', 'end_time': 40000, 'id': 7868, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 22000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Bake in the oven at 400°F (200°C) for 20 minutes, until fully cooked.', 'end_time': 41500, 'id': 7869, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 40500, 'temperature': 400}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Using a fork, pull the strands from the cooled spaghetti squash and transfer to serving dish.', 'end_time': 50000, 'id': 7870, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 43000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Top with hot marinara sauce, and a sprinkle of chopped parsley.', 'end_time': 53000, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 53, 'id': 1, 'match': 'chopped', 'start_index': 47}], 'id': 7871, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 50000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 56333, 'id': 7872, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 54000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Spaghetti Squash And Meatballs', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 163, 'carbohydrates': 7, 'fat': 8, 'fiber': 1, 'protein': 15, 'sugar': 2, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/3da6a4a5f30e4642a5260efd1a6e8aa9/BFV16884_SpaghettiSquashAndMeatballs-FB.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 200, 'consumption_total': 1250, 'portion': 600, 'total': 3600, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:15:19+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7321, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 60058, 'file_size': 54956364, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/24232/mp4_1280X720/1487292395_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/24232/mp4_1280X720/1487292395', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': None, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'application/vnd.apple.mpegurl', 'duration': 60035, 'file_size': None, 'height': 1080, 'maximum_bit_rate': 8252, 'minimum_bit_rate': 277, 'name': 'low', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/24232/1445289064805-h2exzu/1487292395_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/24232/low_1487292395.m3u8', 'width': 1080}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7314, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 60058, 'file_size': 54904411, 'height': 640, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_640x640', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/24232/mp4_640x640/1487292395_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/24232/mp4_640x640/1487292395', 'width': 640}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7328, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 60058, 'file_size': 55006048, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': 