oppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '5 Amazing Meatball Recipes ', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '5-amazing-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/1c2995208f694197a4d2cdae0535988a/JetFBMeatballs.jpg', 'video_id': 39607, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/69379/hls24_1513798345.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1576638857, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1339', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1576479268, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1339, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"5 Meatball Recipes You Can't Resist\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '5-meatball-recipes-you-can-t-resist', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/247851.jpg', 'video_id': 97304, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/154983/hls24_1576234793.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1580777511, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1388', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1580453851, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1388, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '11 Deliciously Epic Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '11-deliciously-epic-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/253648.jpg', 'video_id': 99735, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/159047/hls24_1580453958.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1633104589, 'aspect_ratio': None, 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2832', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1631890708, 'description': 'Ground beef is cheap, easy, nutritious, and straight-up delicious. If you love it like we do, try our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-meatball-bake\">mozzarella-packed meatball bake</a>. Or these <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/beef-and-cheese-empanada\">beef and cheese empanadas</a> are perfect for on-the-go snacking. You can also serve a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/scalloped-potato-roll\">ground beef stuffed scalloped potato roll</a> to impress the guests at your next party! See, the options go on and on. ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2832, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Everything You Can Make From Ground Beef', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'everything-you-can-make-from-ground-beef', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/545b4882eac34e7da1de88e7e96514ef/FB1.jpg', 'video_id': 141659, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/216423/hls24_1631891906.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1635864464, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2908', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1635420000, 'description': 'Everyone loves meatballs, and these easy recipes will make you a meatball expert in no time. Our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/teriyaki-meatballs\">teriyaki meatballs</a> are the perfect blend of sweet and savory, and we absolutely love these <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bbq-bacon-onion-meatball-bomb\">BBQ bacon and onion-wrapped meatballs</a>. Looking for something to impress a crowd? Give our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/giant-spaghetti-stuffed-meatball\">giant spaghetti-stuffed meatball</a> a go. It’s always a crowd favorite.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2908, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Homemade Fancy Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'homemade-fancy-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/349526.jpg', 'video_id': 143754, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/220430/hls24_1635419991.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1650404281, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3117', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1649415489, 'description': 'Ever wondered why Jerry could not keep his hands off the cheese? Cheese is not only \"Tasty\" but tis\\' loved by all. Balance your sweet side with something savoury by trying out these cheesy recipes.. and see for yourself why Jerry kept coming back for more.  SAY YES TO CHEESE!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3117, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Cheese the Pain Away', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'cheese-the-pain-away', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/373214.jpg', 'video_id': 155104, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/236137/hls24_1649796728.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1652970321, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3166', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1652425041, 'description': 'Meatballs are easy and fun to make from scratch and they\\'re perfect for all of your favorite recipes! You can pair them with spaghetti, sandwiches, soups, and game-day snacks! We are here to share some amazing meatball recipes with you! Try out our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-meatball-bake\">Cheesy Meatball Bake</a> and these cheesy and crispy. <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-mozzarella-sticks\">Meatball Mozzarella Sticks</a> that will make you the King or Queen of meatballs!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3166, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatballs For Everyone!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'meatballs-for-everyone', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/377777.jpg', 'video_id': 157501, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/239268/hls24_1652425377.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 30, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1493236071, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Hector Gomez', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Say hello to this mouthwatering Cheesy Meatball Bake that'll have your taste buds dancing! With gooey mozzarella and savory meatballs, this dish is perfect for a cozy night in or a family gathering.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 819, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large mixing bowl, combine ground beef, Italian sausage, garlic, parsley, parmesan cheese, salt, pepper,  bread crumbs, eggs, and milk. Mix until everything is fully infused together.', 'end_time': 19467, 'id': 5773, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roll into 4-5 ounce (113-142 g) meatballs. For even amounts, use a medium-sized ice cream scooper.', 'end_time': 27367, 'id': 5774, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 19567, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 5772, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Over medium heat, add 1 tablespoon of olive oil to a pan, and brown the meatballs on both sides for about 2-3 minutes or until you create a nice crispy sear. Cook about half way through. They will finish cooking in the oven.', 'end_time': 33317, 'id': 5775, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 27917, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a casserole dish, spread a few tablespoons of marinara sauce to the bottom of the pan to help prevent sticking. Then place meatballs in the casserole dish and add the remaining jar of marinara sauce. Top with 2 cups of shredded mozzarella cheese.', 'end_time': 42417, 'id': 5776, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 34016, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Cover in foil and bake at 425°F (220°C) for 25 minutes or until the cheese is fully melted and the meatballs are fully cooked.', 'end_time': 49117, 'id': 5777, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 43417, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Serve and garnish with parsley.', 'end_time': 54917, 'id': 5778, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 50117, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 58467, 'id': 5779, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 55167, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Cheesy Meatball Bake', 'num_servings': 20, 'nutrition': {'calories': 243, 'carbohydrates': 10, 'fat': 15, 'fiber': 0, 'protein': 15, 'sugar': 2, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/b0cbe8fcc2704e288f217de76629fd91/BFV17528_Cheesy_Meatball_Bake_FB_end_card-.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 30, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 100, 'consumption_total': 2050, 'portion': 150, 'total': 2800, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:12:49+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7411, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 64730, 'file_size': 59957026, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/25914/mp4_1280X720/1488936027_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/25914/mp4_1280X720/1488936027', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_r