t for you. From our unique <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/tomato-and-anchovy-pasta\">tomato anchovy pasta</a> to mouth-watering <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-chicken-bacon-and-goat-cheese\">chicken, bacon and goat cheese pasta</a>, these recipes are made to impress! We\\'re going to go eat our hearts out now: time to get cooking!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2219, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Make The Perfect Bowl Of Pasta With These Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'make-the-perfect-bowl-of-pasta-with-these-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/314886.jpg', 'video_id': 127253, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/198051/hls24_1617121116.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1617112876, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2232', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1616408480, 'description': 'If you\\'re a hopeless ramen-tic, these international noodle recipes are just for you! Travel to Japan with some <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/tsukemen-dipping-noodles\">Tsukemen Dipping Noodles</a>. Make a pit-stop in Europe with our quick and easy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-swedish-meatball-pasta\">One-Pot Swedish Meatball Pasta</a> or a bowl of rustic <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/rustic-german-potato-noodles\">German potato noodles</a>. You can also slurp away some <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/thai-style-chicken-and-prawn-fried-noodles-pad-thai\">Chicken and Prawn Pad Thai</a>. Hungry yet? ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2232, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Noodles Around The World', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'noodles-around-the-world', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/313577.jpg', 'video_id': 126820, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/197198/hls24_1616410699.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1626275854, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2604', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1625111822, 'description': 'What if you could have pasta for every day of the week? We\\'re here to help you keep it exciting, before you sit down to yet another bowl of Spaghetti and Meatballs. If you need to kick those midweek blues, look no further than our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/chorizo-tomato-rotini-pasta\">Tomato Basil Sausage Pasta</a>. Want something a little more international? We\\'ve got <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-swedish-meatball-pasta\">Swedish Meatball Pasta</a> that\\'s delightful. We\\'re here for a never-ending pasta, and, well, you have to join us! ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2604, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '7 Days 7 Pasta Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '7-days-7-pasta-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/329936.jpg', 'video_id': 133856, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/207974/hls24_1625052715.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1657123771, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3214', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1655465726, 'description': 'Wanna win everyone\\'s heart at the next family dinner? We\\'ve got you covered! Start out with the delicious <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-swedish-meatball-pasta\">One-Pot Swedish Meatball Pasta</a> or try the classy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pan-teriyaki-salmon-dinner\">One-Pan Teriyaki Salmon Dinner</a>. Impress everyone with your cooking skills!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3214, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '5 Dinner Recipes To Impress Your Family!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '5-dinner-recipes-to-impress-your-family', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/383529.jpg', 'video_id': 160124, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/243156/hls24_1655466140.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 20, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1493235998, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': None, 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'Savory Swedish meatballs, pasta, and a creamy sauce combine in this deliciously hearty one-pot meal. ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 444, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl, combine the ground beef, breadcrumbs, onion, egg, ½ tablespoon salt, and ½ tablespoon pepper, mixing until evenly combined.', 'end_time': 13567, 'id': 2529, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'stovetop', 'display_text': 'Heat the canola oil in a pot over medium-high heat. Take about a golf-ball size of the meatball mixture and roll it into balls. Place the meatballs into the pot, cooking for one minute. Flip the meatballs.', 'end_time': 21269, 'id': 9594, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 14267, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the beef broth, milk, remaining ½ tablespoon salt, remaining ½ tablespoon pepper, and Worcestershire sauce and give it a stir.', 'end_time': 33167, 'id': 2530, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 22267, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'food_thermometer', 'display_text': 'Bring the liquid to a boil, then add the egg noodles. Stir constantly until the pasta is cooked and the liquid has reduced to a sauce that coats the noodles, about seven to eight minutes.', 'end_time': 46117, 'hacks': [{'end_in