y night and the weekend is knocking on your door, urging you to celebrate and let loose. Whether you like to hit the clubs or your own personal cozy corner, these recipes will be your best companions as you kick off the weekend the right way. With the classic <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/the-best-crispy-buffalo-wings\">Crispy Buffalo Wing</a> to the playful <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/kenyan-beef-samosas\">Kenyan Beef Samosas</a>, weekends can’t start off any better!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3294, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Friday Night Lights', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'friday-night-lights', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/394726.jpg', 'video_id': 165641, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/250987/hls24_1661151033.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 20, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1500666238, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Swasti Shukla', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Ditch the beef and create a flavor-packed twist on a classic dish! Made with ground turkey and a medley of spices, they're the perfect protein to add to your pasta, sandwiches, or even just to snack on!\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1982, 'inspired_by_url': 'http://wishfulchef.com/baked-turkey-meatballs/', 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 400ºF (200ºC).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16726, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 400}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the turkey, breadcrumbs, egg, salt, pepper, and olive oil to a bowl and mix to combine.', 'end_time': 61000, 'id': 16727, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 53000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Form the meat into 15 meatballs approximately 2-inches (5cm) across.', 'end_time