e, 'name': 'Hitomi Aihara', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'Juicy meatballs are cooked in a sweet and tangy orange glaze alongside crispy veggies for a balanced and flavorful meal that is sure to impress.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 940, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 475°F (240°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 6797, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 475}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a bowl, combine all ingredients for the meatballs. Mix until all ingredients are incorporated.', 'end_time': 14000, 'id': 6798, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Using your hands or a spoon, roll a bit of the meat mixture in between your hands until a meatball is formed. Place on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.', 'end_time': 19000, 'id': 6799, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 15000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Next to the meatballs, spread assorted veggies and lightly with drizzle oil, salt, and pepper.', 'end_time': 28637, 'id': 6800, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 20000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake at for 15 minutes, or until meatballs are cooked through and vegetables are soft.', 'end_time': 0, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 60, 'id': 21, 'match': 'cooked through', 'start_index': 47}], 'id': 6801, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a microwave-safe bowl, add all the ingredients for the orange sauce.', 'end_time': 44117, 'id': 6802, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 31267, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Stir orange sauce until well combined.', 'end_time': 47750, 'id': 10270, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 44667, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Microwave for 1 minute, stirring at 30 seconds.', 'end_time': 