'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/160158/hls24_1581494129.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1607958478, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1892', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1606914115, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1892, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"Tasty's Favorite Giant Foods\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'tasty-s-favorite-giant-foods', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/296751.jpg', 'video_id': 118711, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/187008/hls24_1606914812.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1609168064, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1976', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1608242813, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1976, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Cheese-Stuffed Recipes To Drown Your Problems In', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'cheese-stuffed-recipes-to-drown-your-problems-in', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/299242.jpg', 'video_id': 121121, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/188342/hls24_1607993417.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1633357552, 'aspect_ratio': None, 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2847', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1632474865, 'description': 'Let\\'s talk about spaghetti. In our opinion, it\\'s one of the most comforting foods in the world. That means you should be making it often. Try it in the form of a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/giant-spaghetti-stuffed-meatball\">giant spaghetti-stuffed meatball</a> or make <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/lemon-chicken-spaghetti-squash\">lemon chicken with spaghetti squash</a>. Elevate classic spaghetti and tomato sauce with the addition of our indulgent bone marrow sauce. There\\'s no bad way to eat spaghetti, after all.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2847, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Eat Spaghetti To Forgetti Your Regrettis', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'eat-spaghetti-to-forgetti-your-regrettis', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/f2f78cb77f7a44a3a0f2a3fb9136b8a5/FB2.jpeg', 'video_id': 142181, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/217111/hls24_1632473478.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1635864464, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2908', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1635420000, 'description': 'Everyone loves meatballs, and these easy recipes will make you a meatball expert in no time. Our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/teriyaki-meatballs\">teriyaki meatballs</a> are the perfect blend of sweet and savory, and we absolutely love these <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bbq-bacon-onion-meatball-bomb\">BBQ bacon and onion-wrapped meatballs</a>. Looking for something to impress a crowd? Give our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/giant-spaghetti-stuffed-meatball\">giant spaghetti-stuffed meatball</a> a go. It’s always a crowd favorite.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2908, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Homemade Fancy Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'homemade-fancy-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/349526.jpg', 'video_id': 143754, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/220430/hls24_1635419991.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 40, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1504192096, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Hannah Williams', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'This meatball is a showstopper! The surprise spaghetti is hidden inside the meatball, making it a delicious and filling meal that will delight your guests.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2403, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a bowl, add the Italian sausage, ground beef, bread crumbs, parsley, salt, pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, Parmesan, eggs, and milk, and mix until well combined.', 'end_time': 20220, 'id': 20136, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 2440, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Line a large glass bowl with plastic wrap, and spray thoroughly with cooking spray.', 'end_time': 26340, 'id': 20137, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 21220, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spread the meat mixture along the bottom and sides of the bowl, about ½-inch (1 cm) thick.', 'end_time': 34220, 'id': 20138, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 26869, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle mozzarella in the base of the meat mixture, then top the spaghetti with sauce on top.', 'end_time': 40600, 'id': 20139, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 34760, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Using the plastic wrap, form the meat into a large ball, ensuring there are no holes or cracks.', 'end_time': 51180, 'id': 20140, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 41450, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 20135, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 375}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place ball on a foil-lined baking sheet.', 'end_time': 53580, 'id': 20141, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 52019, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 40 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 20208, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place a large spoon full of marinara in the center of a plate. Top with the spaghetti-stuffed meatball, marinara, Parmesan, and basil.', 'end_time': 71530, 'id': 20142, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 57860, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 88300, 'id': 20143, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 72380, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'crazy, extreme, giant, italian, meat, meatball, pasta, spaghetti, tomato', 'language': 'und', 'name': 'Giant Spaghetti-Stuffed Meatball', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 744, 'carbohydrates': 43, 'fat': 41, 'fiber': 2, 'protein': 45, 'sugar': 3, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/61cd7299b71e4768a236c1208d4a51e4/SPAGHETTISTUFFEDMEATBALL-FBFINAL.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 250, 'consumption_total': 1350, 'portion': 450, 'total': 2650, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:08:49+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7571, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 93594, 'file_size': 88566808, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/50462/mp4_1280X720/1504202178_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/50462/mp4_1280X720/1504202178', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': None, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'application/vnd.apple.mpegurl', 'duration': 93569, 'file_size': None, 'height': 1080, 'maximum_bit_rate': 8185, 'minimum_bit_rate': 277, 'name': 'low', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/50462/1445289064805-h2exzu/1504202178_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.