pg', 'video_id': 47797, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/79002/hls24_1518658411.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1519225966, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:476', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1519152988, 'description': 'Looking to feed and impress a crowd without much effort? These easy party food recipes are here for you. We’re talking things like a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/blooming-quesadilla-ring\">blooming chicken quesadilla ring</a> and <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-spinach-and-artichoke-bread-ring-dip\">cheesy spinach and artichoke bread dip</a>, among others. These require very little skills and make for super impressive (and super yummy!) party treats.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 476, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '9 Mind-Blowing Party Food Rings', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '9-mind-blowing-party-food-rings', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/138182.jpg', 'video_id': 48432, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/79966/hls24_1519152052.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1558361763, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:954', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1558088277, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 954, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '7 Food Rings To Jazz Up Your Next Party', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '7-food-rings-to-jazz-up-your-next-party', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/c32cdf0c00234e59b352781a2ab070a2/fbthumb1.jpg', 'video_id': 83621, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/133081/hls24_1558089309.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1596462688, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1499', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1590584908, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1499, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Warm And Cheesy Garlic Breads', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'warm-and-cheesy-garlic-breads', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/267327.jpg', 'video_id': 105204, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/168446/hls24_1590584184.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1615904558, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2206', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1615366779, 'description': 'We\\'ve curated a list of lip-smacking recipes that will make you \\'gar-lick\\' your fingers. The <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/3-cheese-garlic-bread\">3-cheese garlic bread</a> is a classic and great for a party or movie night. For a more decadent option, dig into the <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/honey-garlic-slow-cooker-ribs\">honey garlic slow cooker ribs</a>. The <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/40-clove-garlic-chicken\">40-clove garlic chicken</a> is also a must try. After all, we all know that there is no such thing as too much garlic!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2206, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"'Gar-lick' Your Fingers With These Mouthwatering Recipes\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'gar-lick-your-fingers-with-these-mouthwatering-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/311683.jpg', 'video_id': 126550, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/195972/hls24_1615368805.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1625236118, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2556', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1624998950, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2556, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Garlic Bread Recipes For Each Day Of The Week', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'garlic-bread-recipes-for-each-day-of-the-week', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/329634.jpg', 'video_id': 134561, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/207759/hls24_1624999352.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 30, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1493236064, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alix Traeger', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Dive into this mouthwatering Cheesy Garlic Bread Meatball Ring that's perfect for sharing! With its gooey cheese and tender meatballs, this dish is a guaranteed crowd-pleaser.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 780, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium bowl, combine the ground beef, egg, bread crumbs, 2 tablespoons of parsley, salt, and pepper. Mix well.', 'end_time': 9850, 'id': 5420, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pinch off a ball of the mixture, roll between your hands to make ping pong ball-sized meatball. Repeat with the rest of the meat.', 'end_time': 12267, 'id': 5421, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 10850, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large pan, cook the meatballs over medium heat, turning to brown each side. Remove from heat and drain on a paper towel.', 'end_time': 16417, 'id': 5422, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 13267, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 350°F (180˚C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 5419, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pinch off a portion of pizza dough and, with your hands or a rolling pin, flatten out and top with a tablespoon of marinara sauce and mozzarella cheese. Add a meatball and wrap the dough over, pinching at the seams to close. Repeat with the remaining ingredients.', 'end_time': 24467, 'id': 5423, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 17417, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Arrange the balls in a circle, seam-side down, in a large cast-iron skillet.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 5425, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Mix the melted butter with the garlic, remaining 2 tablespoons of parsley, and the Parmesan. Brush the balls with the garlic butter mixture.', 'end_time': 40333, 'id': 37934, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 31000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 20 minutes, or until golden brown. Let cool for 5-10 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 5427, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place a bowl of warm marinara sauce in the middle of the skillet, then serve.', 'end_time': 46017, 'id': 5428, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 43317, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 50766, 'id': 5429, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 47017, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'appetizer, bake, beef, bread, buzzfeed, cheese, cheesy, comfort food, dinner, game day, garlic bread, meatball, mozzarella, skillet, tasty, tomato', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Cheesy Garlic Bread Meatball Ring', 'num_servings': 8, 'nutrition': {'calories': 501, 'carbohydrates': 35, 'fat': 27, 'fiber': 1, 'protein': 27, 'sugar': 2, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/dda08d5da5444bde91bd901e4