 'cooking_style', 'type': 'cooking_style'}, {'display_name': 'Appliance', 'id': 9295811, 'name': 'appliance', 'parent_tag_name': None, 'root_tag_type': 'appliance', 'type': 'appliance'}, {'display_name': 'Meal', 'id': 9295813, 'name': 'meal', 'parent_tag_name': None, 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'meal'}, {'display_name': 'Difficulty', 'id': 9295816, 'name': 'difficulty', 'parent_tag_name': None, 'root_tag_type': 'difficulty', 'type': 'difficulty'}, {'display_name': 'Occasion', 'id': 9299134, 'name': 'occasion', 'parent_tag_name': 'seasonal', 'root_tag_type': 'seasonal', 'type': 'seasonal'}, {'display_name': 'Bread', 'id': 9299362, 'name': 'bread', 'parent_tag_name': 'baking', 'root_tag_type': 'appliance', 'type': 'baking'}, {'display_name': 'Rolls', 'id': 9299363, 'name': 'rolls', 'parent_tag_name': 'baking', 'root_tag_type': 'appliance', 'type': 'baking'}, {'display_name': 'Breads & Pastries', 'id': 9299369, 'name': 'breads_pastries', 'parent_tag_name': 'breakfast', 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'breakfast'}, {'display_name': 'Beef', 'id': 9299515, 'name': 'beef', 'parent_tag_name': 'dinner', 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'dinner'}, {'display_name': 'Dips', 'id': 9299663, 'name': 'dips', 'parent_tag_name': 'appetizers', 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'appetizers'}, {'display_name': 'Sliders', 'id': 9299664, 'name': 'sliders', 'parent_tag_name': 'appetizers', 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'appetizers'}, {'display_name': 'Eggs', 'id': 10623588, 'name': 'eggs', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}, {'display_name': 'Gluten', 'id': 10623589, 'name': 'gluten', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}, {'display_name': 'Dairy', 'id': 10623608, 'name': 'dairy', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}], 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/fe5b11a8411f4d4cbf1f3bbe81cdec66/Thumb_c.jpg', 'tips_and_ratings_enabled': True, 'tips_summary': {'by_line': 'Powered By Botatouille', 'content': '• Be mindful of meatball size and dough portions to avoid a messy outcome 🍕👌\\n• Use less sauce to make wrapping easier or serve it on the side for dipping 🍅➡️\\n• Switch it up with biscuit or bread dough for a softer, tastier treat 🥖✨\\n• Add flavor bombs like garlic and onion powder to the meatball mix for a flavor explosion 💥🧄\\n• Cook meatballs in a cast iron skillet before wrapping them for that extra crispy goodness! 🔥🍽️', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Baked Goods', 'slug': 'baked-goods'}, {'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Lunch', 'slug': 'lunch'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Snacks', 'slug': 'snacks'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 60, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 17, 'count_positive': 269, 'score': 0.9405594405594405}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 11572, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/22629/low_1485905424.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 8-10'}, {'approved_at': 1541809744, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:4541', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1630001604, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2752', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1629975850, 'description': 'Who doesn\\'t love a good Disney movie delight? From the iconic <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/spaghetti-and-meatballs\">Spaghetti and Meatballs</a> of Lady and the Tramp to Remy\\'s <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/ratatouille\">Ratatouille</a>, Disney makes your mouth water and your heart sing (and don\\'t we know it)! So we\\'re here to make all your dreams come true – well, culinary ones, that is. Delve into our world of Disney, rife with magical treats galore. Get ready to enter a world undiscovered. ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2752, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Disney-Inspired Recipes You Have To Try!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'disney-inspired-recipes-you-have-to-try', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/339117.jpg', 'video_id': 139829, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/214060/hls24_1629975789.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 70, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1541614658, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Matthew Johnson', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'This classic Italian dish features tender spaghetti tossed in a rich tomato sauce, served with juicy meatballs and a sprinkle of parmesan cheese. Perfect for a cozy and comforting dinner with family and friends.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 4541, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C). Set a wire rack over a baking sheet and grease with nonstick spray.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 41384, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Make the marinara sauce: Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat. Add the onions and garlic and season with salt, pepper, and the red pepper flakes. Cook until soft and caramelized, about 15 minutes.', 'end_time': 34733, 'id': 41385, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 18000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Set aside ⅓ cup (50 G) of the cooked onions and garlic for the meatballs and let cool.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 41386, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Stir the tomato paste into the onions and cook until browned and aromatic, 3-5 minutes.', 'end_time': 45166, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 59, 'id': 13, 'match': 'browned', 'start_index': 53}], 'id': 41387, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 40000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the crushed tomatoes, dried basil, dried oregano, and dried parsley. Stir together and bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for at least 30 minutes.', 'end_time': 75000, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 148, 'id': 17, 'match': 'simmer', 'start_index': 143}, {'end_index': 105, 'id': 18, 'match': 'boil', 'start_index': 102}], 'id': 41388, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 64833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Make the meatballs: In a large bowl, combine the ground beef, ground pork, reserved onion and garlic mixture, bread crumbs, ricotta, parsley, eggs, Parmesan, milk, salt, and pepper. Mix with your hands until well combined.', 'end_time': 103000, 'id': 41389, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 80666, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Shape about 2 ounces (55 G) of meat at a time into balls and set on the prepared wire rack.', 'end_time': 112166, 'id': 41390, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 104000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'food_thermometer', 'display_text': 'Bake the meatballs for 20 minutes, until the outsides are browned and the centers are tender and juicy and reach about 155˚F (68˚C).', 'end_time': 120833, 'hacks': [], 'id': 41391, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 112666, 'temperature': 155}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bring a large pot of water to boil and add a generous pinch of salt. Cook the pasta according to the package instructions, 7-10 minutes, until al dente. Stir occasionally to keep the noodles from sticking together.', 'end_time': 135000, 'hacks': [], 'id': 41392, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 121833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Drain the pasta and add it directly to the simmering marinara sauce. Reserve some pasta water, in case you need it to loosen the sauce. Stir the pasta into the sauce until fully coated.', 'end_time': 162833, 'hacks': [], 'id': 41393, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 153000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the pasta to serving bowls, top with the meatballs, and garnish with Parmesan, fresh basil, and cracked pepper.', 'end_time': 168833, 'id': 41394, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 164000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 173833, 'id': 41395, 'position': 12, 'start_time': 170333, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'baking, best, best ever, buzzfeed, classic, classic recipes, cooking, easy, easy recipes, food, ground beef, how to, how to bake, how to cook, how to make, lessons, marinara, matthew francis johnson, pasta, pasta sauce, perfect, quick and easy, recipe, recipes, simple easy, spaghetti and meatballs, tasty, teach me, tomato, ultimate, yum, yummy', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Spaghetti And Meatballs', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 1100, 'carbohydrates': 117, 'fat': 41, 'fiber': 12, 'protein': 67, 'sugar': 24, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/20974166cb29420394d7622ef5a8ba60/FB_1.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 60, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 300, 'consumption_total': 1700, 'portion': 750, 'total': 4350, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:02:38+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'squa