'dinner', 'root_tag_type': 'meal', 'type': 'dinner'}, {'display_name': 'Eggs', 'id': 10623588, 'name': 'eggs', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}, {'display_name': 'Gluten', 'id': 10623589, 'name': 'gluten', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}, {'display_name': 'Dairy', 'id': 10623608, 'name': 'dairy', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}], 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/186685.jpg', 'tips_and_ratings_enabled': True, 'topics': [{'name': 'Baked Goods', 'slug': 'baked-goods'}, {'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Pasta', 'slug': 'pasta'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 130, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 2.5 hours', 'tier': 'under_2.5_hours'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 38, 'count_positive': 931, 'score': 0.9607843137254902}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 68787, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/114066/hls24_1541116042.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 6'}, {'approved_at': 1503704694, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': 4614867, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:2352', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1634310044, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2890', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1633519626, 'description': 'If you\\'re a Brooklyn Nine-Nine fan, look no further than these bites, curated specifically for lovers of this comedy favorite. With these recipes, you can get a taste for Terry\\'s obsession with <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/mixed-berry-frozen-yogurt\">yogurt</a>, join Boyle\\'s in-depth <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-from-scratch-in-20-minutes-or-less\">pizza analysis</a>, and channel your inner Amy with a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/nicoise-salad\">Niçoise salad</a>. Cook up some <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/the-best-crispy-buffalo-wings\">crispy buffalo wings</a> and pretend to be Hitchcock and Scully back in the day. Or you can practice your own <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/ice-cream-donut-holes\">donut hole</a> slam dunks with your partner in crime like Rosa and Jake. What are you waiting for?', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2890, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Our Fave Foods From Brooklyn Nine-Nine', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'our-fave-foods-from-brooklyn-nine-nine', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/345939.jpg', 'video_id': 142526, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/218269/hls24_1633520052.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1648228583, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3096', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1647313252, 'description': 'March is here and that means so is a season of magnificent basketball! It’s time to get your brackets straight and cheer your heart out for your time. From <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-chicken-nuggets\">Cheesy Chicken Nuggets</a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/fish-and-chips\">Fish & Chips</a>, we are making sure that you get the perfect fuel for this action-packed season. Turn the game on, sit back on your couch and get yourself one of our tasty snacks!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3096, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Snacks for March Madness', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'snacks-for-march-madness', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/6169dddf43b84b8c9a373e19aff41c76/March_Madness_OnO.jpg', 'video_id': 153725, 'video_url': None}, {'approved_at': 1669843735, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3371', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1668990945, 'description': 'Your job might be a joke, you might be broke, and your love life might be DOA, but your palate is definitely going to be satisfied with these recipes! Tasty has organized a very F.R.I.E.N.D-ly birthday celebration for Ross. Obviously, we are going to serve the <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/leftover-turkey-sandwich\">Leftover Turkey Sandwich</a> (you might have to add your own moist maker), followed by <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cherry-pie-filled-cheesecake\">Cherry Pie-Filled Cheesecake</a>, which made Rachel and Chandler fight to the death. Fret not, we have something for you AND all your friends.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3371, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'A F.R.I.E.N.D-ly Birthday Celebration for Ross', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'a-f-r-i-e-n-d-ly-birthday-celebration-for-ross', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/412005.jpg', 'video_id': 174440, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/262889/hls24_1668990821.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 35, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1503507403, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alix Traeger', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"These meatball sub boats are a fun and delicious twist on a classic sandwich. They're made with juicy meatballs, marinara sauce, and topped with melty mozzarella cheese, all served in a fluffy bread boat.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2352, 'inspired_by_url': 'https://www.buzzfeed.com/alvinzhou/these-chili-cheese-dog-boats-are-amazing', 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl, combine the ground beef, eggs, bread crumbs, ¼ cup (10 g) parsley, 3 cloves garlic, salt, and pepper.', 'end_time': 12549, 'id': 19667, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Shape the ground beef mixture into golf ball-sized balls.', 'end_time': 15230, 'id': 19668, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 13230, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'stovetop', 'display_text': 'Heat a cast-iron pan or skillet with oil over medium-high heat.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 19669, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cook the meatballs until browned on all sides. Transfer meatballs to a plate then remove pan from heat.', 'end_time': 21700, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 31, 'id': 13, 'match': 'browned', 'start_index': 25}], 'id': 19670, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 15610, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 19666, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place the soft rolls in a baking sheet.', 'end_time': 23350, 'id': 19671, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 22090, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cut the top of the rolls with a knife and press the inside down to create a boat.', 'end_time': 29720, 'id': 19672, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 24050, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Mix together the melted butter, 3 cloves garlic, and 2 tablespoons of parsley.', 'end_time': 34500, 'id': 19673, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 30419, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Brush the rolls with the garlic butter.', 'end_time': 38750, 'id': 19674, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 35350, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 5 minutes, or until toasted.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 19675, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place two slices of mozzarella in the rolls. Place a spoonful of marinara on top of the cheese.', 'end_time': 46560, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 14, 'id': 6, 'match': 'slice', 'start_index': 10}], 'id': 19676, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 41750, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place three meatballs in the boat and top with more marinara.', 'end_time': 53770, 'id': 19677, 'position': 12, 'start_time': 47410, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 25 minutes, or until cheese is melted.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 19678, 'position': 13, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Top with Parmesan.', 'end_time': 58720, 'id': 19679, 'position': 14, 'start_time': 55790, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 65790, 'id': 19680, 'position': 15, 'start_time': 60980, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'buzzfeed, cheese, comfort food, dinner, garlic bread, marinara, mashup, meatball, mozzarella, parmesan, tasty ', 'language': 'und', 'name': 'Meatball Sub Boats', 'num_servings': 4, 'nutrition': {'calories': 1156, 'carbohydrates': 58, 'fat': 63, 'fiber': 3, 'protein': 79, 'sugar': 7, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/a224af2ec5fe47be8a97702b81411e10/fb.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 400, 'consumption_total': 1550, 'portion': 650, 'total': 2600, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:08:59+01:0