hing and better cooking results! 🍽️\\n• Cook those meatballs a bit longer to ensure they're fully cooked! 🔥\\n• Add more seasoning or different types of cheese for a flavor explosion! 🧀💥\\n• Experiment with alternative breads like ciabatta or hot dog buns for a twist! 🥖🌭\\n• Reduce baking time or remove some bread to avoid a hard crust! ⏱️🍞\", 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Lunch', 'slug': 'lunch'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 55, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1684101600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 27, 'count_positive': 673, 'score': 0.9614285714285714}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 27118, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/48910/low_1503509403.m3u8', 'yields': 'Serves: 4-8'}, {'approved_at': 1502751822, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:2271', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1502823009, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:173', 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1502485664, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 173, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'und', 'name': 'Party Meatballs 4 Ways', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'party-meatballs-4-ways', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/566b664bfd4a4b0a8df9c30a19333a95/fb_1.jpg', 'video_id': 25011, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/47184/low_1502490038.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1513810641, 'aspect_ratio': None, 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': 4709853, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:365', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1513810136, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 365, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '5 Amazing Meatball Recipes ', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '5-amazing-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/1c2995208f694197a4d2cdae0535988a/JetFBMeatballs.jpg', 'video_id': 39607, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/69379/hls24_1513798345.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1580777511, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1388', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1580453851, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1388, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '11 Deliciously Epic Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '11-deliciously-epic-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/253648.jpg', 'video_id': 99735, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/159047/hls24_1580453958.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 25, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1502485660, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Matthew Johnson', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"You can't go wrong with classic Italian meatballs smothered in a rich and savory marinara sauce. These meatballs are packed with flavor and will transport you straight to Nonna's kitchen with every bite.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2271, 'inspired_by_url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-OWAuvnC3K4&list=PLYzBQ8Dkg3ikw_LCDaNHzAfp0M6RIxy9v&index=6', 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 19080, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium-size bowl mix together the beef, pork, bread crumbs, onion, parsley, garlic, eggs, salt, and pepper until just combined.', 'end_time': 13500, 'id': 19081, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 3500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Take a walnut size of the meat mixture and roll into a ball. Repeat with remaining meat and transfer to an oiled rack on a sheet tray.', 'end_time': 19000, 'id': 19082, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 14500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake meatballs for 15 minutes, until golden brown. Set aside.', 'end_time': 21000, 'id': 19083, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 20000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add a little oil to a pan on medium-high heat and cook the onions and garlic until they are deeply caramelized.', 'end_time': 108290, 'id': 19084, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 107290, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add in the oregano, parsley, basil, red pepper flakes, tomato paste, and tomato sauce.', 'end_time': 115000, 'id': 19085, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 109000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Stir the mixture and bring to a simmer for 5 minutes.', 'end_time': 119500, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 37, 'id': 17, 'match': 'simmer', 'start_index': 32}], 'id': 19086, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 116000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the meatballs and coat them with the sauce.', 'end_time': 123290, 'id': 19087, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 120500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese, poke with toothpicks, and serve!', 'end_time': 128000, 'id': 19088, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 124290, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 130850, 'id': 19089, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 129000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': ', balls, barbecue, bbq, beef, best, best ever, buzzfeed, cheese, cheesy, classic, cocktail, cook, easy, food, galzed yum, garlic, ginger, glaxe, honey, how to, marinara, meatball, meatballs, mini, onion, parm, parmsean, party meatballs, perfect, pork, recipe, sauce, saucy, sesame, soy, swedish, tasty, teriyaki, tomato, toothpick, ultimate, yummy', 'language': 'und', 'name': 'Marinara Meatballs', 'num_servings': 40, 'nutrition': {'calories': 84, 'carbohydrates': 3, 'fat': 4, 'fiber': 0, 'protein': 6, 'sugar': 0, 'updated_at': '2025-04-22T08:21:55+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/8f9e929d3d334bdeb60d65085358367e/FB_05_for_Final.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 30, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 50, 'consumption_total': 1200, 'portion': 50, 'total': 2200, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:09:06+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7314, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 149402, 'file_size': 136581580, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/47184/mp4_1280X720/1502490038_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/47184/mp4_1280X720/1502490038', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': None, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'application/vnd.apple.mpegurl', 'duration': 149358, 'file_size': None, 'height': 1080, 'maximum_bit_rate': 7903, 'minimum_bit_rate': 274, 'name': 'low', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/47184/1445289064805-h2exzu/1502490038_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/47184/low_1502490038.m3u8', 'width': 1080}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7281, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 149402, 'file_size': 135960946, 'height': 640, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 