 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1835', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1605502278, 'description': 'We\\'ve come back with our all-time favorite meatball recipes! These super quick and easy recipes are the perfect fix for those super busy days. Take your pick from cheesy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-crust-pizza-star\">Meatball Stuffed Crust Pizza</a> or a fancy Instagram ready <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-onion-ring-cone\">Onion Rings Meatball Cone</a>. We promise you won\\'t be able to settle at just one. So, pick your favorite and let\\'s get cookin\\'!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1835, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball With A Twist', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'meatball-with-a-twist', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/293613.jpg', 'video_id': 118512, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/185176/hls24_1605502908.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 25, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1542416110, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Rie McClenny', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Warm up with this comforting Chicken Meatball Soup that's loaded with tender veggies and savory meatballs. It's a hearty, flavorful meal that'll leave you feeling satisfied and cozy.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 4563, 'inspired_by_url': 'https://damndelicious.net/2018/07/29/italian-wedding-soup/', 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Make the meatballs: In a medium bowl, combine the ground chicken, bread crumbs, egg, Parmesan, garlic, parsley, salt, and pepper. Mix well, then roll into 1-inch (2 cm) meatballs. You should have 16-18 total.', 'end_time': 25166, 'id': 41661, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 5000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat. Sear the meatballs on all sides until golden brown, 4-5 minutes. Remove from the pot and set aside.', 'end_time': 39166, 'id': 41662, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 28833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Make the soup: In the same pot, heat the remaining tablespoon of oil.  Add the onion, carrot, and celery and cook, stirring occasionally until tender, 3-4 minutes. Add the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.', 'end_time': 57500, 'id': 41663, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 39000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the chicken stock and bay leaf.  Cover and bring to a boil.', 'end_time': 64666, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 61, 'id': 18, 'match': 'boil', 'start_index': 58}], 'id': 41664, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 59000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Once boiling, add the orzo and meatballs. Cover and simmer for 7-8 minutes, until the orzo is tender.', 'end_time': 81000, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 57, 'id': 17, 'match': 'simmer', 'start_index': 52}], 'id': 41665, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 68000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the Swiss chard, cover, and cook for 2-3 minutes, until the chard has wilted.', 'end_time': 90333, 'id': 41666, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 83000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add the Parmesan cheese and season to taste with salt and pepper. Add the lemon juice.', 'end_time': 104666, 'id': 41667, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 91000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Ladle into bowls and serve.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 41668, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 114350, 'id': 41669, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 111333, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'chicken soup, chicken stock, easy, fall soup, italian wedding soup, meatball recipe, orzo, swiss chard, winter', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Chicken Meatball Soup', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 435, 'carbohydrates': 47, 'fat': 18, 'fiber': 4, 'protein': 35, 'sugar': 9, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/a957d0c5ffe14dc8aaf478d2fdd38367/SoupOO.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 200, 'consumption_total': 1150, 'portion': 450, 'total': 2650, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:02:31+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 2441, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 131247, 'file_size': 40036512, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/117803/square_720/1543624762_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/117803/square_720/1543624762', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 812, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 131247, 'file_size': 13309248, 'height': 320, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_320x320', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/117803/square_320/1543624762_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/117803/square_320/1543624762', 'width': 320}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 2439, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 131247, 'file_size': 39999554, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/117803/landscape_720/1543624762_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/117803/landscape_720/1543624762', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 1398, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_