nts_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}, {'display_name': 'Dairy', 'id': 10623608, 'name': 'dairy', 'parent_tag_name': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'root_tag_type': 'ingredients_to_avoid', 'type': 'ingredients_to_avoid'}], 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/6ec67fc6adc0425d9e0216ec0d0e8797/FBthumb.jpg', 'tips_and_ratings_enabled': True, 'tips_summary': {'by_line': 'Powered By Botatouille', 'content': '• Try replacing Swiss chard with spinach or kale for a leafy green twist 🥬\\n• Experiment with ground turkey instead of chicken for a lighter option 🦃\\n• Bake the meatballs instead of frying for a healthier alternative 🍗\\n• Add more vegetables like green beans, white beans, squash, and mushrooms for a nutritious boost 🥦🍄\\n• Get creative with different types of pasta or grains like pearl couscous, ditalini, or rice 🍝🍚', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Fall Recipes', 'slug': 'fall'}, {'name': 'Healthy Eating', 'slug': 'healthy'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Winter Recipes', 'slug': 'winter'}, {'name': 'Lunch', 'slug': 'lunch'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Pasta', 'slug': 'pasta'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 45, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 45 minutes', 'tier': 'under_45_minutes'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 14, 'count_positive': 582, 'score': 0.9765100671140939}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 70524, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/117803/hls24_1543624762.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 6-8'}, {'approved_at': 1501025055, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:1976', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1620847750, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2376', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1619700454, 'description': 'Can you get more American than a classic slider? Our meaty <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/sloppy-joe-sliders\">Sloppy Joe Sliders</a> make for the perfect party snack (or a lazy dinner) and our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pesto-chicken-garlic-knot-sliders\">Pesto Garlic Knot Sliders</a> pack a punch. We also have something for the vegetarians in the group with our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/buffalo-chickpea-sliders\">Buffalo Chickpea Sliders</a>. Get those buns toasting already! ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2376, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"Let These Sliders 'Slide' Into Your Life\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'let-these-sliders-slide-into-your-life', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/319940.jpg', 'video_id': 130790, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/201641/hls24_1619700246.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 30, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1500511586, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Betsy Carter', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'This hearty dish is perfect for feeding a crowd. The meatball slider bake is made with homemade meatballs, marinara sauce, and plenty of cheese.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1976, 'inspired_by_url': 'http://www.homemadeinterest.com/easy-meatball-sliders/', 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 350˚F (180˚C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16609, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl add the ground beef, Italian sausage, garlic, parsley, parmesan cheese, salt, pepper, bread crumbs, eggs, and milk and mix until thoroughly combined.', 'end_time': 17000, 'id': 16610, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roll the mixture into 5 ounce meatballs.', 'end_time': 24000, 'id': 16611, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 18000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Add 1 tablespoon of olive oil to a pan over medium heat and brown the meatballs on both sides for 15 minutes total.', 'end_time': 29000, 'id': 16612, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 25000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Slice the rolls in half lengthwise.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16613, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place the bottom half on a 9 x 13-inch (23 x 33cm) baking dish.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16614, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spoon a little marinara sauce on each bun. Top a meatball on each roll, add another spoonful of sauce, and top with mozzarella cheese.', 'end_time': 45000, 'id': 16615, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 33000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place the remaining half of the rolls on top and lightly brush them with oil.', 'end_time': 54000, 'id': 16616, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 47000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Combine the parmesan cheese and the Italian seasoning in a small bowl and sprinkle it over the buns.', 'end_time': 70000, 'id': 16617, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 55000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 15 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16618, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 76000, 'id': 16619, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 73000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': None, 