content': '• Bake the bottom half of the sliders before adding sauce to keep them from becoming soggy 🍞✨\\n• Adjust the size of the meatballs for easier munching—smaller is better! 🍔🔪\\n• Consider cooking the meatballs longer to ensure they’re cooked through—nobody likes raw meatballs! ⏲️😬\\n• For a shortcut, try pre-made or frozen meatballs—your busy schedule will thank you! 🥳🍽️\\n• Spice things up with garlic salt, Parmesan, or a cheese blend instead of plain mozzarella—flavor explosion! 🧄🧀', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 60, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1692050400, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 5, 'count_positive': 230, 'score': 0.9787234042553191}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 22252, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/44413/low_1500582990.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 12'}, {'approved_at': 1518135183, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/317416550d6c4249b782ed4d87d62de8/BeautyShodt.jpg', 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': 4745311, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:3469', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1533866540, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:631', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1533851485, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 631, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '4 Easy Crispy Bacon Snacks', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '4-easy-crispy-bacon-snacks', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/173077.jpg', 'video_id': 63996, 'video_url': 'https://vid.