a way to make every meals interesting. Pair your favorite bacon with the classic <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/creamy-bacon-chive-hasselback-potatoes\">hasselback potatoes</a> or combine it with <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bacon-and-egg-fried-rice\">fried rice</a> for a wholesome meal. Sizzle your way through all these dishes!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1948, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '9 Unique Ways To Cook Bacon', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '9-unique-ways-to-cook-bacon', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/289927.jpg', 'video_id': 116253, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/183153/hls24_1603872935.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1636384248, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2917', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1635452545, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2917, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Recipes That Will Actually Leave Your Mouth Watering', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'recipes-that-will-actually-leave-your-mouth-watering', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/349671.jpg', 'video_id': 144582, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/220651/hls24_1635452752.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 30, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1518050040, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alix Traeger', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Savor the smoky goodness of these BBQ Bacon Ice Tray Meatballs, a perfect appetizer for your next gathering. With a unique ice tray hack, you'll have everyone asking for your secret to these mouthwatering, bacon-wrapped delights.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3469, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium-sized bowl, mix the ground beef, onion, parsley, bread crumbs, egg, garlic, oregano, basil, salt, and pepper until combined. Set aside.', 'end_time': 18599, 'id': 29556, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 2833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 29555, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 400}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Line two empty ice trays with bacon, overlapping each piece to cover the tray completely.', 'end_time': 27500, 'id': 29557, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 21000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Press the bacon down into each round with two fingers.', 'end_time': 31166, 'id': 29558, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 29000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spoon some of the meatball mixture into each round and press down to smooth. Make sure to pack the meat down to touch the bottom of the ice tray.', 'end_time': 42933, 'id': 29559, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 33333, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Fold the edges of the bacon on top of the ice tray.', 'end_time': 51000, 'id': 29560, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 43000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Flip the ice tray over onto a baking sheet and carefully lift the ice cube tray off of the meatballs.', 'end_time': 54166, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 73, 'id': 5, 'match': 'cube', 'start_index': 70}], 'id': 29561, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 52000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 20 minutes, or until bacon is just brown.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 29562, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Brush the meatballs with barbecue sauce and bake for 10 minutes, or until the bacon is crispy and meatballs are cooked through.', 'end_time': 68333, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 125, 'id': 21, 'match': 'cooked through', 'start_index': 112}], 'id': 29563, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 58000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Transfer the meatball sheet to a cutting board and cut the bacon to create single meatballs.', 'end_time': 79166, 'id': 29564, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 71000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place a toothpick in each meatball.', 'end_time': 87333, 'id': 29565, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 81000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 100833, 'id': 29566, 'position': 12, 'start_time': 88000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': ', bacon, bbq, beef, buzzfeed, ice tray, meatball, party, tasty', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'BBQ Bacon Ice Tray Meatballs', 'num_servings': 24, 'nutrition': {'calories': 74, 'carbohydrates': 3, 'fat': 3, 'fiber': 0, 'protein': 6, 'sugar': 1, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/b1e613540a8648f2996d33c9105b6bf7/fb_1.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 50, 'consumption_total': 700, 'portion': 50, 'total': 1650, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:06:28+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 1952, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 111087, 'file_size': 27093491, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/77454/square_720/1518118860_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/77454/square_720/1518118860', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 650, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 111087, 'file_size': 9012784,