 meatballs 🥓\\n• Add BBQ sauce after baking for a flavor boost 🍖\\n• Mix in garlic powder or onion powder for extra deliciousness 🧄🧅\\n• Broil the meatballs at the end to get that golden, crispy top! 🔥', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'BBQ Season', 'slug': 'bbq'}, {'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Low Carb Meals', 'slug': 'low-carb-meals'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Snacks', 'slug': 'snacks'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}], 'total_time_minutes': 50, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 27, 'count_positive': 283, 'score': 0.9129032258064517}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 46408, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/77454/hls24_1518118860.m3u8', 'yields': 'Makes 24 meatballs'}, {'approved_at': 1496365728, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:303', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1618410159, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2272', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1617217944, 'description': 'We’ve got the easiest and fastest meal plan for an entire week. Not sold yet? Each meal only needs 4 ingredients. Kickstart your Monday with our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/peach-feta-avocado-toast\">Avocado Peach and Feta Toast</a> and round out your weekend with a classic comfort food: a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bean-and-cheese-toaster-quesadilla\">Bean and Cheese Burrito</a>. Cooking doesn\\'t have to be hard or intimidating: in fact, it\\'s a 4-step process of fun!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2272, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '4 Ingredient Recipes For An Entire Week', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '4-ingredient-recipes-for-an-entire-week', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/315255.jpg', 'video_id': 126360, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/198299/hls24_1617218767.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1670282984, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3378', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1669696151, 'description': 'These recipes are for those lazy days we all experience. Those days when even moving your finger feels like a chore! Well, we know how you feel, and so we have perfectly curated these easy \"lazy\" recipes you can make so that you can extend your nap just a little longer! From <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/hasselback-pizza-chicken\"> Hasselback Pizza Chicken </a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-sub-bake\"> Meatball Sub Bake </a>, we have you covered. So sit back and be lazy. After all, you deserve it! ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3378, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Recipes to Make When Laziness Kicks In!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'lazy-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/413549.jpg', 'video_id': 175116, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/264001/hls24_1669674903.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 35, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1493235977, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': None, 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'This meatball sub bake is the perfect easy weeknight meal. Juicy meatballs and melted cheese are sandwiched between layers of fluffy bread, making for a savory and satisfying dish that the whole family will love.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 303, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 1886, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 375}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cut each refrigerated biscuit into 8 pieces.  Place in a greased 9x13 inch (23x33 cm) baking dish.', 'end_time': 10117, 'id': 1887, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pour on the sauce, and stir to coat all sides of the biscuits.', 'end_time': 16517, 'id': 1888, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 11117, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place the meatballs on top of the mixture.', 'end_time': 20817, 'id': 1889, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 17667, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Top with the shredded cheese, and bake for 35 minutes.', 'end_time': 29017, 'id': 1890, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 21817, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 39767, 'id': 1891, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 31717, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball Sub Bake', 'num_servings': 4, 'nutrition': {'calories': 1165, 'carbohydrates': 85, 'fat': 73, 'fiber': 4, 'protein': 42, 'sugar': 48, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/5898d7ab01e34817b5e92923cf2e38a8/BFV5796_MeatballSubBake-FB1080SQ.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 10, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 300, 'consumption_total': 1250, 'portion': 550, 'total': 2200, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:14:33+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 7408, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 42138, 'file_size