g them 🥓💥\\n• Switch up the BBQ sauce game with teriyaki or create a glaze with ketchup and brown sugar for a sweet twist 🍖🍯\\n• Add a sprinkle of mixed herbs or Dijon mustard to elevate those flavor vibes 🌿🎉\\n• Cook those meatballs on the BBQ or smoker for a smoky goodness that’ll impress the crowd 🔥🍽️', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'BBQ Season', 'slug': 'bbq'}, {'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}], 'total_time_minutes': 55, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 19, 'count_positive': 351, 'score': 0.9486486486486486}, 'video_ad_content': 'undetermined', 'video_id': 15325, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/31851/low_1495124849.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 2-3'}, {'approved_at': 1512444261, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': 4696846, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:3110', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1513290969, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/fbc91eb8587947e1b109e2db875329c3/6DINNERS_BEAUTY-2.jpg', 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:305', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1512081678, 'description': 'From vegetarian <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/black-bean-burgers\">black bean burgers</a> to plant-powered <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/protein-packed-buddha-bowl\">Buddha bowls</a>, these easy meat-free meals will warm you up and keep you fueled for hours. All of them are high in protein and you can mix and match ingredients depending on what you have handy in the fridge or pantry. They’re perfect for your next Meatless Monday dinner or meal-prepped lunch!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 305, 'is_shoppable': True, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '6 High Protein Vegetarian Dinners', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 34, 'name': 'Goodful'}], 'slug': '6-high-protein-vegetarian-dinners', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/119707.jpg', 'video_id': 36847, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/65581/hls24_1512413358.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1610375110, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2025', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1609773056, 'description': 'Trying to cut down on meat? We\\'ve hand-picked simple and easy vegetarian dinner recipes that will make you stop craving meat altogether! Choose from our mouthwatering <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/tofu-tikka-masala\">tofu tikka masala</a> or healthy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/zucchini-ravioli\">zucchini-ravioli</a> and feast away! ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2025, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Delicious Vegetarian Dinners', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'delicious-vegetarian-dinners', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/302019.jpg', 'video_id': 121938, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/189937/hls24_1609773813.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 15, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1512081677, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Kahnita Wilkerson', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'These flavorful meatballs are made with protein-packed lentils and are perfect for serving with pasta, on top of pizza, or even in a sandwich.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3110, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 375˚F (190˚C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 25831, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 375}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Heat a large skillet over medium heat then add 1 tablespoon of olive oil, shallot and garlic and sauté for 2-3 minutes, or until slightly golden brown then remove from heat.', 'end_time': 227240, 'id': 25832, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 220240, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'To a food processor, add the garlic and shallot, lentils, egg, 1 teaspoon of olive oil,  tomato paste, parsley, Parmesan, bread crumbs, Italian seasonings, salt, and pepper and pulse, mixing until just combined.', 'end_time': 245830, 'id': 25833, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 229160, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Transfer the mixture to a medium-sized bowl.', 'end_time': 249100, 'id': 25834, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 246420, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Use a cookie dough scoop to scoop out balls of mixture then carefully form into balls.', 'end_time': 252890, 'id': 25835, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 249680, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Arrange on a parchment paper-lined baking sheet.', 'end_time': 254329, 'id': 25836, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 253080, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 10-15 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 25837, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Remove meatballs from oven and allow to cool for 5-10 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 25838, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Serve with spaghetti.', 'end_time': 263320, 'id': 25839, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 257900, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 265859, 'id': 25840, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 264440, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscrib