f breast and thighs for moister meatballs 🍗\\n• Cut back on salt since Parmesan brings the salty goodness already 🧂\\n• Use baking paper or oil your foil to keep those meatballs from sticking like they’re at a dance party 🎉\\n• Experiment with spices like turmeric and cumin for a tikka masala twist that’ll spice up your life! 🌶️', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Easy Dinner', 'slug': 'easy-dinner'}, {'name': 'Healthy Eating', 'slug': 'healthy'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Low Carb Meals', 'slug': 'low-carb-meals'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Lunch', 'slug': 'lunch'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Pasta', 'slug': 'pasta'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 40, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 45 minutes', 'tier': 'under_45_minutes'}, 'updated_at': 1692050400, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 3, 'count_positive': 93, 'score': 0.96875}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 128517, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/202768/hls24_1620865112.m3u8', 'yields': 'Makes 14 meatballs'}, {'approved_at': 1498580885, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:664', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1563388491, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1027', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1563344461, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1027, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '8 Savory Recipes For Garlic Lovers', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '8-savory-recipes-for-garlic-lovers', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/225766.jpg', 'video_id': 87269, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/139307/hls24_1563345755.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1596462688, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1499', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1590584908, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1499, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Warm And Cheesy Garlic Breads', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'warm-and-cheesy-garlic-breads', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/267327.jpg', 'video_id': 105204, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/168446/hls24_1590584184.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1604411982, 'aspect_ratio': '16:9', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1771', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1603982959, 'description': \"The one thing we love more than our quirky, bubbly Tasty producer, Alix is her mouthwatering recipes! We’ve picked out Alix's top 5, absolutely best of the best recipes just for you. Discover the secret ingredient she uses in her Mac ‘n’ Cheese and then eat your way through her delicious apple pies. Let us know which recipe was your favorite and what secret ingredient do you use in your recipes.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1771, 'is_shoppable': True, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Five Recipes With Alix', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'five-recipes-with-alix', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/290342.jpg', 'video_id': 117156, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/183374/hls24_1603984769.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1615904628, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2209', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1615532050, 'description': 'Don\\'t you just love it when you bite into something and it has a hidden surprise? We do too! And we\\'ve got just the perfect list of stuffed foods for you. The light <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/mango-stuffed-sticky-rice-balls\">Mango-Stuffed Sticky Rice Balls</a> make the perfect summer snack. The <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/mango-stuffed-sticky-rice-balls\">Queso Lava cakes</a> are great to impress your friends with. And the <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/peach-cobbler-stuffed-beignets\">Peach Cobbler Stuffed Beignets</a> are to die for. Each bite will be a total surprise, guaranteed! ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2209, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Stuffed Foods For A Party In Your Mouth', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'stuffed-foods-for-a-party-in-your-mouth', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/312039.jpg', 'video_id': 126357, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/196197/hls24_1615532577.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1620921737, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2383', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1619766740, 'description': 'If there\\'s one thing that gets everyone\\'s tastebuds tingling, it\\'s garlic bread. Whether it\\'s a classic <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/3-cheese-garlic-bread\">Cheesy Loaf</a> or one loaded with <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/spinach-and-artichoke-garlic-bread\">spinach and artichokes</a>, it will not disappoint. We personally love our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/chili-cheese-garlic-bread-rolls\">Chili Cheese Garlic Bread</a> the most (shh, don\\'t tell the others). After all, you can never go wrong with garlic bread!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2383, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'The Ultimate Garlic Bread Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'the-ultimate-garlic-bread-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/320209.jpg', 'video_id': 130703, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/201797/hls24_1619767750.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1675108802, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3491', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1675009547, 'description': 'Ah, bread! You just can’t go wrong with bread. Whether you’re hosting a fancy dinner party with a charcuterie board and wine, or you’re just at a game day eating bite-size bread appetizers, there’s a bread for every mood! If you love bread as much as we do, you have to try out a luscious <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheese-fondue-bread-boat\">Cheese Fondue Bread Boat</a>, a finger-lickin’ <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/chili-dog-bread-ring\">Chili Dog Bread Ring</a> for a game night, or a classic with a twist, <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-garlic-bread\">Meatball-Stuffed Garlic Bread</a>!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3491, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '6 Bread Recipes In 6 Minutes!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'easy-bread-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/423835.jpg', 'video_id': 180035, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/271092/hls24_1675009536.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 25, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1493236040, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alix Traeger', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"This recipe is a match made in heaven. Soft, garlicky bread stuffed with juicy meatballs and melty cheese – you'll never want regular garlic bread again!\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 664, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 350°F (180˚C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 4278, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 350}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium bowl, mix the ground beef, bread crumbs, parsley, egg, salt, and pepper.', 'end_time': 9167, 'id': 4279, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pinch off a ball of the mixture, roll between your hands to make ping-pong ball-sized meatballs.', 'end_time': 11317, 'id': 4280, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 10167, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cook the meatballs over medium heat, turning to brown each side. Remove from heat and drain on a paper towel.', 'end_time': 16617, 'id': 4281, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 12317, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Slice the baguette into thirds or fourths (each baguette piece should be roughly the same length of two meatballs).', 'end_time': 19517, 'id': 4282, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 17617, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Hollow out the insides of the baguette pieces with a knife.', 'end_time': 22867, 'id': 4283, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 20517, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Lay two slices of mozzarella on top of each other with a 1-inch (2 cm) overlap. Place two meatballs on the overlapping region, then fold the mozzarella tightly around the meatballs.', 'end_time': 28317, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 12, 'id': 6, 'match': 'slice', 'start_index': 8}], 'id': 4284, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 23867, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Push the rolled meatballs and cheese into a baguette piece.', 'end_time': 30317, 'id': 4285, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 29317, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Slice the stuffed baguette pieces into 1-inch (2 cm) slices, then place them tightly side-by-side on a baking sheet lined with foil.', 'end_time': 33217, 'hacks': [], 'id': 4286, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 31317, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a small bowl, mix together ingredients for garlic butter.', 'end_time': 38217, 'id': 4287, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 34217, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Brush the garlic butter evenly over the baguette slices, making sure some drips in between the slices.', 'end_time': 42317, 'hacks': [], 'id': 4288, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 39217, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Wrap the foil over the re-assembled baguette and bake for 15–20 minutes, until cheese is melted and the top is starting to brown.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 4289, 'position': 12, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Remove the foil and serve with marinara.', 'end_time': 46267, 'id': 4290, 'position': 13, 'start_time': 44817, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 49467, 'id': 4291, 'position': 14, 'start_time': 47267, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'bake, beef, buzzfeed, cheese, garlic, garlic bread, meatball, mozzarella, tasty ', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball-Stuffed Garlic Bread', 'num_servings': 4, 'nutrition': {'calories': 758, 'carbohydrates': 48, 'fat': 39, 'fiber': 2, 'protein': 49, 'sugar': 4, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/167afd4bc5a44a28ba09d91c92463d23/BFV15294_Meatball-Stuffed_Garlic_Bread_FB.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 30, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 250, 'consumption_total': 1050, 'portion': 500, 'total': 1950, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:12:23+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'