://tasty.co/recipe/vegan-mac-n-cheese\">vegan version of mac \\'n\\' cheese</a> to delicious <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/spaghetti-meatball-bake\">baked meatballs and spaghetti</a>, these ideas will satisfy every craving. Pair your pasta with a salad, dessert, and glass of wine — and you\\'ve got a restaurant-quality menu right at home!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1684, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"Tasty's Best Pasta Recipes\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'tasty-s-best-pasta-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/281005.jpg', 'video_id': 112179, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/177582/hls24_1598903165.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 0, 'country': 'GB', 'created_at': 1565128235, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': None, 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'This Spaghetti Meatball Bake is a classic Italian-American dish that is sure to please the whole family! The spaghetti is perfectly cooked, the meatballs are juicy and flavorful, and the melted cheese on top adds a delicious creaminess. This dish is a crowd-pleaser that is perfect for any occasion.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 5481, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat the oven to 200°C/400°F/Gas Mark 6.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 49321, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 400}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Mix all of the meatball ingredients together into a large bowl, then form into 14 golfball-sized balls.', 'end_time': 21500, 'id': 49322, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 11000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Combine the full jar of sauce and half a jar of water together in a large bowl.', 'end_time': 3833, 'id': 49323, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Stir in the spaghetti until it’s fully coated in the sauce.', 'end_time': 6333, 'id': 49324, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 4000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spread the coated spaghetti into a casserole dish then top with the meatballs.', 'end_time': 10433, 'id': 49325, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 7500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cover and bake in the centre of the oven for 18-20 minutes.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 49326, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle over the cheese and grill/broil for a further 5-7 minutes uncovered, until the cheese is melted and stringy and the top of the meatballs are brown.', 'end_time': 30166, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 39, 'id': 12, 'match': 'broil', 'start_index': 35}, {'end_index': 33, 'id': 16, 'match': 'grill', 'start_index': 29}], 'id': 49327, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 27833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle over the basil and serve immediately.', 'end_time': 37099, 'id': 49328, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 32500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 41333, 'id': 49329, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 38000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': '', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Spaghetti Meatball Bake', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 516, 'carbohydrates': 45, 'fat': 18, 'fiber': 3, 'protein': 34, 'sugar': 2, 'updated_at': '2024-05-01T08:05:31+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/02947c270f784c1fa6922b53025c177a/BFV12725_Spaghetti_Meatball_Bake.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 0, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 250, 'consumption_total': 1600, 'portion': 400, 'total': 2400, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06