er party. But wait, just before you eat, make sure to keep your phone handy for those beautiful Instagram shots!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2181, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Squash Meals', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'squash-meals', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/309023.jpg', 'video_id': 125370, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/194268/hls24_1614105461.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1621605126, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2395', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1620986492, 'description': 'An eggplant may have always stumped you but with our many recipes, it doesn\\'t have to anymore! Want something truly out of the box? Deep fry that lone eggplant to make some <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/eggplant-nachos\">nachos</a> or <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/eggplant-rings\">rings</a> to pair with a pint of beer. Thinking Italian? Add it to your <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/spaghetti-squash-and-eggplant-meatballs\">meatballs</a> with some squash and sit it atop a bed of spaghetti for a lovely weeknight dinner. Heck, you can also make some <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/eggplant-brownies\">decadent brownies</a> from eggplants! (Yes, you read that right.) So get cookin\\' already!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2395, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Recipes That Will Make You Love Eggplants', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'recipes-that-will-make-you-love-eggplants', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/321899.jpg', 'video_id': 131477, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/202914/hls24_1620986707.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 100, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1513872509, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': \"Merle O'Neal\", 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'A vegetarian-friendly dish that features spaghetti squash and eggplant \"meatballs\" in a tomato sauce.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3241, 'inspired_by_url': 'https://www.skinnytaste.com/eggplant-meatballs/', 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat oven to 375ºF (190ºC).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 27318, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 375}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Combine eggplant, onion, garlic, oil, salt, pepper, and oregano on a baking sheet. Bake for 30 minutes, mixing halfway.', 'end_time': 21040, 'id': 27319, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 4260, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In the bowl of a food processor, combine eggplant mixture, basil, parsley, Parmesan, bread crumbs, ricotta, oregano, and egg, and blend until smooth.', 'end_time': 43810, 'id': 27320, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 24320, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roll the mixture into golf ball-sized balls. Transfer to a cast iron pan spacing them about 2 inches apart from each other. Bake for 20 minutes.', 'end_time': 51290, 'id': 27321, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 44820, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'On a baking sheet, cover spaghetti squash with oil, salt, and pepper, add to oven and bake for 40 minutes.', 'end_time': 59840, 'id': 27322, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 51291, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Remove meatballs, add marinara sauce, and return to oven for 10 minutes.', 'end_time': 67970, 'id': 27323, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 61150, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Remove spaghetti squash from the oven and with a fork pull at the edges to produce that stringy “spaghetti” quality.', 'end_time': 73740, 