mpilation:684', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1538760857, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 684, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '12 Tasty Bombs', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '12-tasty-bombs', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/182396.jpg', 'video_id': 67681, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/111430/hls24_1538761277.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1635864464, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2908', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1635420000, 'description': 'Everyone loves meatballs, and these easy recipes will make you a meatball expert in no time. Our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/teriyaki-meatballs\">teriyaki meatballs</a> are the perfect blend of sweet and savory, and we absolutely love these <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bbq-bacon-onion-meatball-bomb\">BBQ bacon and onion-wrapped meatballs</a>. Looking for something to impress a crowd? Give our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/giant-spaghetti-stuffed-meatball\">giant spaghetti-stuffed meatball</a> a go. It’s always a crowd favorite.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2908, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Homemade Fancy Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'homemade-fancy-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/349526.jpg', 'video_id': 143754, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/220430/hls24_1635419991.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1682095698, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3556', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1681281812, 'description': 'BBQ season is right around the corner and we’re honestly here for it! This is the perfect time to grill up some incredible dishes and spend the day outside with your friends and family! We’re bringing you some of our favorite finger-licking barbecue recipes to make this cookout your best one yet. From delicious <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/bbq-chicken-pizza-tacos\">BBQ Chicken Pizza Tacos</a> to a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/giant-bbq-rib-sandwich-to-feed-a-crowd\">Giant BBQ Rib Sandwich</a> that can feed a whole crowd, these recipes are sure to satisfy!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3556, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '7 Easy BBQ Recipes For Your Next Cookout!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'easy-bbq-cookout-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/439752.jpg', 'video_id': 188775, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/283661/hls24_1681281808.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 45, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1501114135, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Pierce Abernathy', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Get ready to have your taste buds explode with this BBQ Bacon Onion Meatball Bomb! It's a mouthwatering combination of juicy meatballs, crispy bacon, and caramelized onions, all smothered in tangy BBQ sauce. Trust us, this is one flavor-packed dish you won't want to miss!\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2082, 'inspired_by_url': 'http://beef.littlethings.com/bbq-bacon-meatball-recipe', 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat the oven to 425˚F (220˚C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 17636, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl, mix the ground beef, garlic powder, onion powder, pepper, salt, bread crumbs, garlic, diced onion, parsley, egg, ketchup, mustard, Worcestershire sauce, and honey until evenly combined. Set aside in the refrigerator.', 'end_time': 17040, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 107, 'id': 3, 'match': 'diced', 'start_index': 103}], 'id': 17637, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cut the 4 onions vertically on cutting board. Remove the stem and root from each piece. The layers of each onion will act as \"shells\" to wrap around each meatball.', 'end_time': 25520, 'id': 17638, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 18320, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Remove the meatball mixture from the refrigerator and pinch off golf ball-sized pieces of meat. Press a small cube of cheddar cheese into the middle of each meat portion, then form into a meatball shape with your hands.', 'end_time': 38110, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 113, 'id': 5, 'match': 'cube', 'start_index': 110}], 'id': 17640, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 29000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Wrap each meatball in 2 onion \"shells\", then with 2 strips of bacon, and transfer to the prepared baking sheet. ', 'end_time': 54400, 'id': 17641, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 39110, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Brush the meatballs with barbecue sauce, covering them completely.', 'end_time': 60500, 'id': 40113, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 55166, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 45 minutes, brushing again with BBQ sauce halfway through, until deep brown with a nice crust on the outside.', 'end_time': 64483, 'id': 17644, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 61160, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 73259, 'id': 17645, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 67220, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': ', bacon, bacon onion, bacon wrapped, bacon-wrapped, bbq, bbq ba