ating', 'slug': 'healthy'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}], 'total_time_minutes': 180, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 2.5 hours', 'tier': 'under_2.5_hours'}, 'updated_at': 1684101600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 17, 'count_positive': 261, 'score': 0.9388489208633094}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 39393, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/74558/hls24_1516819294.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 4-6'}, {'approved_at': 1560362148, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:5352', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1580777511, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1388', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1580453851, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1388, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '11 Deliciously Epic Meatball Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '11-deliciously-epic-meatball-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/253648.jpg', 'video_id': 99735, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/159047/hls24_1580453958.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1606746672, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1835', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1605502278, 'description': 'We\\'ve come back with our all-time favorite meatball recipes! These super quick and easy recipes are the perfect fix for those super busy days. Take your pick from cheesy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-crust-pizza-star\">Meatball Stuffed Crust Pizza</a> or a fancy Instagram ready <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-onion-ring-cone\">Onion Rings Meatball Cone</a>. We promise you won\\'t be able to settle at just one. So, pick your favorite and let\\'s get cookin\\'!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1835, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball With A Twist', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'meatball-with-a-twist', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/293613.jpg', 'video_id': 118512, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/185176/hls24_1605502908.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1652970321, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3166', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1652425041, 'description': 'Meatballs are easy and fun to make from scratch and they\\'re perfect for all of your favorite recipes! You can pair them with spaghetti, sandwiches, soups, and game-day snacks! We are here to share some amazing meatball recipes with you! Try out our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesy-meatball-bake\">Cheesy Meatball Bake</a> and these cheesy and crispy. <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-mozzarella-sticks\">Meatball Mozzarella Sticks</a> that will make you the King or Queen of meatballs!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3166, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatballs For Everyone!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'meatballs-for-everyone', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/377777.jpg', 'video_id': 157501, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/239268/hls24_1652425377.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 0, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1560291756, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Tayo Ola', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Take a classic Indian favorite to the next level. The tender and juicy chicken meatballs are bathed in a rich and creamy buttery tomato sauce that's infused with aromatic spices. Whether you enjoy them over a bed of fluffy basmati rice or nestled in a warm naan bread, these meatballs will have you saying 'Flavor town, here I come!\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 5352, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Meatballs: In a medium bowl, stir together bread crumbs and milk. Let sit for 5 minutes. Add in garlic, egg, salt, and pepper, then stir until well-combined. Stir in ground chicken. Combine well, but do not overmix. With oiled hands, roll the meat into golf-size balls.', 'end_time': 30000, 'id': 48212, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 4000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pour 1 tablespoon vegetable oil into a skillet over medium heat. Add meatballs and brown on all sides. Remove meatballs from the pan (meatballs will not be fully cooked through at this time). Wipe the pan out to make the sauce.', 'end_time': 45500, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 175, 'id': 21, 'match': 'cooked through', 'start_index': 162}], 'id': 48213, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 31000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sauce: Heat vegetable oil and butter in the same skillet over medium heat. Add onions and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes. Add garlic and ginger, then let sizzle for a minute or two. ', 'end_time': 63166, 'id': 48214, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 47000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Stir in McCormick Ground Cumin, McCormick Paprika, 1½ teaspoons garam masala, cayenne, and salt. Let spices heat through until fragrant, about 2 minutes. Add crushed tomatoes and bring sauce to a simmer, then take off the heat.', 'end_time': 94166, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 201, 'id': 17, 'match': 'simmer', 'start_index': 196}], 'id': 48225, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 66000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Let the sauce cool for 5–10 minutes. Blend sauce until smooth, adding a tablespoon or two of water if it is too thick to blend.', 'end_time': 103833, 'id': 48215, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 96000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Pour the sauce back into the skillet. Whisk in the butter, cream, and 1 teaspoon garam masala. Add the meatballs to the sauce and stir to coat. Cover and cook for 5 minutes, or until meatballs are fully cooked through.', 'end_time': 126000, 'hacks': [], 'id': 48216, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 105000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Garnish with cilantro. Serve with rice and lime wedges.', 'end_time': 134833, 'id': 48217, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 132000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 139500, 'id': 48224, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 137500, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': '', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Butter Chicken Meatballs', 'num_servings': 4, 'nutrition': {'calories': 707, 'carbohydrates': 37, 'fat': 49, 'fiber': 4, 'protein': 35, 'sugar': 12, 'updated_at': '2024-05-01T08:06:00+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/0f2df408c15b42c79557909a864a9628/McCormick_EditSpon32_250083_GM_v02_FB.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 0, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 200, 'consumption_total': 800, 'portion': 500, 'total': 2100, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:17:28+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 2333, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 142734, 'file_size': 41610752, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/135638/square_720/1560291392_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/1356