ushroom-skewers\">bacon mushroom skewers</a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/chicken-meatball-skewers\">chicken meatball skewers</a>, take your pick and get grilling!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 50, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Japanese Grilled Skewers 4 Ways (Kushiyaki)', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'japanese-grilled-skewers-4-ways-kushiyaki', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/0c8440f18c564aee814d5daa6502fb37/BFV15627_Yakitori4Ways-YT.jpg', 'video_id': 9978, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/18741/low_1482261352.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1580777656, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1368', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1579772523, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1368, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '11 Street Food Recipes You Can Make At Home', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '11-street-food-recipes-you-can-make-at-home', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/252775.jpg', 'video_id': 98859, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/158404/hls24_1579766156.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1612190593, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2079', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1611759740, 'description': 'Whether you’re in the mood for spicy or tangy flavors, you\\'ll find them all in these mouthwatering skewer recipes. They\\'re all high in protein and will keep you fueled until your next meal. They\\'re also a perfect party option for your next family gathering. So take your pick — from <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/cheesesteak-skewers-in-a-box\">Ultimate Cheesesteak Skewers</a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/antipasto-skewers\">Antipasto Skewers</a> — and let’s get started!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2079, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '12 Skewer Recipes', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '12-skewer-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/304638.jpg', 'video_id': 123289, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/191445/hls24_1611760218.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1613140431, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2154', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1613114525, 'description': 'A special day calls for some truly special food. Bake your partner a bunch of <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/potato-roses\">Bacon Wrapped Potato Roses</a>. Then, these<a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/caprese-pops\">Caprese Pops</a> are perfect to get you and your loved one\\'s appetite going. Ditch regular flowers for some pretty <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/flower-sushi-roll\">Flower Sushi Rolls</a>. Whatever your choice is, these appetizers have love and flavor written all over them!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2154, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"Valentine's Dinner Appetizers\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'valentine-s-dinner-appetizers', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/307612.jpg', 'video_id': 124654, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/193326/hls24_1613114896.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1624982187, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2521', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1622636008, 'description': 'Let your taste buds travel around the world with these global street food recipes. Kick off your world tour with a wild <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/korean-tornado-potatoes\">Tornado Potato</a> and work your way up to a flavorful <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/mexican-style-pork-tacos-tacos-al-pastor\">Taco Al Pastor</a>. Enjoy the taste of every culture, right from your very own kitchen!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2521, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Street Food Recipes Around The World', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'street-food-recipes-around-the-world', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/325238.jpg', 'video_id': 130937, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/204907/hls24_1622636584.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1624398907, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2534', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1624027617, 'description': 'It\\'s Father\\'s Day, and you know what that calls for? Dad-approved recipes and a whole bunch of Dad jokes! Make sure to test out the <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/one-pot-cheeseburger-pasta\">One Pot Cheeseburger Pasta</a> with your Dad and then chase it down with his favorite <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/scalloped-potatoes\">Creamy Scalloped Potatoes!</a> \\nPaired with the perfect gifts and an afternoon BBQ, we\\'re about to make this Father\\'s Day the best one yet. ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2534, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Dad Approved Recipes!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'dad-approved-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/943c46fc5d1042e894f0dac91bb1e78e/facebook_thumb.jpg', 'video_id': 133842, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/206181/hls24_1623748316.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1628185396, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2716', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1627665461, 'description': ' You\\'ve been cooped up for far too long, and we know what you\\'re craving: street foods, fair foods, FUN food. Well, we have it all! Kick the night off with some wild <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/tornado-potato\">Potato Tornado</a> and work your way up to a flavorful <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/kenyan-beef-samosas\">Beef Samosa</a>. Enjoy!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2716, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Street Food Lovers! ', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'street-food-lovers', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/334566.jpg', 'video_id': 137445, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/211185/hls24_1627666365.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1630682323, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2772', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1630040692, 'description': 'You\\'ve heard of Vogue\\'s 73 Questions, but how about 73 snacks? You heard us right. We\\'ve got the widest collection of snacks you can think of — no matter what your mood. From <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/sweet-potato-fries\">sweet potato fries</a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/popcorn-fried-chicken-indian-style\">chicken poppers</a>, we\\'re bringing your cravings to your doorstep. You ready? ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2772, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '73 Snacks From Tasty', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '73-snacks-from-tasty', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/340274.jpg', 'video_id': 140204, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/214743/hls24_1630482634.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 15, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1499746069, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alvin Zhou', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'Satisfy your hunger with the delicious chicken meatball skewers. These juicy meatballs are seasoned with green onions and ginger, and are perfect for grilling or baking. Served with a flavorful soy glaze, they make an easy weeknight meal.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1486, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium pot, combine all ingredients for glaze and bring to a boil until the bubbles start to become sticky and glossy.', 'end_time': 9480, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 69, 'id': 18, 'match': 'boil', 'start_index': 66}], 'id': 13318, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Combine the ground chicken, green onions, ginger, sesame oil, and ¼ cup (60 ml) of the soy glaze in a bowl until evenly mixed.', 'end_time': 67200, 'id': 13314, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 59000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'If the mixture does not hold its shape when rolled into a ball, add in panko breadcrumbs, mix evenly, and re-roll the meatballs to test their structural integrity.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16905, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roll about 1-inch (2 ½ cm) meatballs, then skewer 3-4 meatballs on a skewer. Repeat with remaining mixture.', 'end_time': 75580, 'id': 13315, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 69000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 13316, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sear 3-4 skewers at a time and flip when the undersides are golden brown.', 'end_time': 80000, 'id': 13317, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 77000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Brush the glaze on the skewers evenly and cook for about 5 more minutes, flipping every minute and brushing additional glaze as necessary.', 'end_time': 85470, 'id': 13319, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 81000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cool and serve!', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 16329, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 91000, 'id': 13320, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 86900, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'japanese grilled skewers, japanese skewers, japanese skewers 4 ways, kushiyaki, skewers 4 ways', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Chicken Meatball Skewers', 'num_servings': 6, 'nutrition': {'calories': 257, 'carbohydrates': 15, 'fat': 13, 'fiber': 0, 'protein': 16, 'sugar': 10, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/5ae9fe1ab173471982dbef6a900d4dbf/BFV15627_Yakitori4Ways-FB.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 20, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 50, 'consumption_total': 300, 'portion': 450, 'total': 2650, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:10:36+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': None, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'video/mp4', 'duration': 0, 'file_size': None, 'height': 720, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'name': 'mp4_720x720', 'poster_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-transcoder-prod/output/18741/mp4_1280X720/1482261352_00001.png', 'url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/18741/mp4_1280X720/1482261352', 'width': 720}, {'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': None, 'container': 'mp4', 'content_type': 'application/vnd.apple.mpegurl', 'duration': 0, 'file_size': None, 'height': 1080, 'maximum_bit_rate': None, 'minimum_bit_rate': None, 'n