aguette into 1-inch (3cm) chunks, then transfer to a 9x13 (23 x 33cm) baking dish.', 'end_time': 9500, 'id': 4428, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 1000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Toss the bread in half of the marinara, then sprinkle with half of the mozzarella on top.', 'end_time': 14817, 'id': 4429, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 10500, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Nestle the meatballs into the bread mixture evenly, then cover with the remaining marinara and mozzarella.', 'end_time': 21500, 'id': 4430, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 16000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle ¾ of the parmesan on top, saving the rest for garnish.', 'end_time': 23000, 'id': 4431, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 22000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 20 minutes until the cheese has melted and is starting to brown.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 4432, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Serve with the remaining parmesan and basil.', 'end_time': 36000, 'id': 4433, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 33000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 39000, 'id': 9968, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 37000, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': ', meatball parm, meatball parm bake', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball Parm Bake', 'num_servings': 4, 'nutrition': {'calories': 920, 'carbohydrates': 59, 'fat': 55, 'fiber': 4, 'protein': 50, 'sugar': 10, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/5a65f0ea36bd4c519fe1ed7093e0955e/BFV15417_MeatballParmBake-FB2.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 15, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 350, 'consumption_total': 1300, 'portion': 650, 'total': 2600, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26