{'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'One-Pot Recipes', 'slug': 'one-pot'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'American', 'slug': 'american'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 35, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 45 minutes', 'tier': 'under_45_minutes'}, 'updated_at': 1684101600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 10, 'count_positive': 114, 'score': 0.9193548387096774}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 9348, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/16815/low_1481054254.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 4-5'}, {'approved_at': 1524579828, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/1445ad3831f64adb89232ba037030300/BeautyShfot.jpg', 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:3770', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1548300598, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:857', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1548220257, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 857, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '12 Appetizer Recipes For Pizza Lovers', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '12-appetizer-recipes-for-pizza-lovers', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/201988.jpg', 'video_id': 76456, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/123336/hls24_1548220575.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1606746672, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1835', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1605502278, 'description': 'We\\'ve come back with our all-time favorite meatball recipes! These super quick and easy recipes are the perfect fix for those super busy days. Take your pick from cheesy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-crust-pizza-star\">Meatball Stuffed Crust Pizza</a> or a fancy Instagram ready <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-onion-ring-cone\">Onion Rings Meatball Cone</a>. We promise you won\\'t be able to settle at just one. So, pick your favorite and let\\'s get cookin\\'!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1835, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball With A Twist', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'meatball-with-a-twist', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/293613.jpg', 'video_id': 118512, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/185176/hls24_1605502908.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1633532789, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2858', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1632746005, 'description': 'Over the years, we\\'ve found countless ways to enjoy the world\\'s most popular food: pizza. Sure, a classic pie is great, but our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-bread-bowl\">pizza bread bowl</a> is just as incredible. If you\\'re looking for a unique mash-up, we\\'ve combined pizza with <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-lasagna\">lasagna</a>, <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/taco-pizza\">tacos</a>, and even <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-cordon-bleu\">chicken cordon bleu</a>. Make these pizza recipes and you\\'ll never run out of ways to say \\'that\\'s amore!\\'  ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2858, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"Tasty's Top Pizzas\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'tasty-s-top-pizzas', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/345118.jpg', 'video_id': 142184, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/217748/hls24_1632994608.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1675285332, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3494', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1675159863, 'description': 'Who can resist pizza? We know we can\\'t. A good pizza is the ultimate showstopper. Everyone loves it. There’s no denying that. But we’re taking it up a notch! No more of that plain Jane stuff. Here are some fun pizza recipes that are total game-changers, one for every night of the month! You’ve gotta try our super cheesy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/pizza-bombs\">Pizza Bombs</a>, our <a href= \"https://tasty.co/recipe/meatball-stuffed-crust-pizza-star\">Meatball-Stuffed Crust Pizza Star</a>, or of course, if you’re craving pizza for breakfast (because honestly, same), our <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/breakfast-pizza-boats\">Breakfast Pizza Boats</a>!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3494, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': '30 Fun Pizza Recipes For The Entire Month! ', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '30-fun-pizza-recipes-for-the-entire-month', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/424184.jpg', 'video_id': 180168, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/271376/hls24_1675236204.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 30, 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1524528485, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alix Traeger', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': 'You’ve probably heard of stuffed crust pizza before, but have you heard of meatball-stuffed crust? That’s right. This pizza recipe completely takes things to the next level. In the middle, it’s your average cheese pizza, but it’s surrounded by a crust loaded with homemade meatballs. It’s the sort of show-stopping party app you’ll want to bookmark for a special occasion.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3770, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': 'oven', 'display_text': 'Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 32978, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': 425}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a large bowl, mix the ground beef, egg, onion, bread crumbs, Parmesan, parsley, garlic, salt, pepper, and oregano.', 'end_time': 23833, 'id': 32979, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 6166, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Roll the mixture into golf ball-sized meatballs.', 'end_time': 26500, 'id': 32980, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 24000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'In a medium cast iron or nonstick skillet, heat oil over medium heat.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 33019, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Working in batches cook the meatballs until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes. Set aside.', 'end_time': 32833, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 50, 'id': 13, 'match': 'browned', 'start_index': 44}], 'id': 32981, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 27000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'On a sheet of parchment paper, press the pizza dough into a large circle, about 12 inches (30-cm) in diameter.', 'end_time': 41116, 'id': 32982, 'position': 6, 'start_time': 37333, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Cut 8 evenly spaced 2-inch (5-cm) slits on the edge of the dough.', 'end_time': 47750, 'id': 32983, 'position': 7, 'start_time': 42000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Place one meatball on the edge of the dough between 2 slits. Pull the corners of the dough around the meatball and press into the dough, sealing the meatball in a dough pocket. Repeat with the remaining meatballs.', 'end_time': 56783, 'id': 32984, 'position': 8, 'start_time': 48833, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'With the help of a friend, transfer the pizza and parchment to a baking sheet.', 'end_time': 59000, 'id': 32985, 'position': 9, 'start_time': 57116, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spoon marinara sauce into the middle of the pizza and spread evenly.', 'end_time': 63166, 'id': 32986, 'position': 10, 'start_time': 61000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Sprinkle mozzarella over the sauce, or add your favorite pizza toppings! Brush the dough around the meatballs with olive oil.', 'end_time': 69333, 'id': 32987, 'position': 11, 'start_time': 64000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Bake for 25 minutes, or until the cheese is bubbly and the dough is golden and just cooked through.', 'end_time': 0, 'hacks': [{'end_index': 97, 'id': 21, 'match': 'cooked through', 'start_index': 84}], 'id': 32988, 'position': 12, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Slice with a pizza cutter and serve.', 'end_time': 81666, 'id': 32989, 'position': 13, 'start_time': 74000, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Enjoy!', 'end_time': 86166, 'id': 32990, 'position': 14, 'start_time': 82500, 'temperature': None}], 'is_app_only': False, 'is_one_top': False, 'is_shoppable': True, 'is_subscriber_content': False, 'keywords': 'beef, buzzfeed, cheese, dinner, kid friendly, meatball, pizza, tasty , tomato', 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Meatball-Stuffed Crust Pizza Star', 'num_servings': 8, 'nutrition': {'calories': 443, 'carbohydrates': 29, 'fat': 23, 'fiber': 1, 'protein': 27, 'sugar': 2, 'updated_at': '2024-09-03T03:10:44+02:00'}, 'nutrition_visibility': 'auto', 'original_video_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/d6aa7793b720469195d0d79e0c50c6e9/fb.mp4', 'prep_time_minutes': 30, 'price': {'consumption_portion': 150, 'consumption_total': 1150, 'portion': 250, 'total': 2050, 'updated_at': '2025-10-26T06:05:20+01:00'}, 'promotion': 'full', 'renditions': [{'aspect': 'square', 'bit_rate': 2020, 'container': 'mp4', 