0e088cf60/BFV17625_HiddenVeggieMeatballs_ThumbFB.jpg', 'tips_and_ratings_enabled': True, 'tips_summary': {'by_line': 'Powered By Botatouille', 'content': '• Use a food processor to finely shred the vegetables for a smoother texture 🥕🔪\\n• Try using a pressure cooker to prevent burning the meat and keep it juicy 🍲🔥\\n• Reduce the amount of onion if it feels overwhelming in flavor 🧅❌\\n• Add more seasoning, especially salt, to enhance the taste 🧂✨\\n• Experiment with different cooking methods: bake at 350°F for 15 mins, flip, then bake for another 15 for perfectly cooked meatballs 🍽️', 'header': 'Highlights'}, 'topics': [{'name': 'Bread Lovers', 'slug': 'bread'}, {'name': 'Healthy Eating', 'slug': 'healthy'}, {'name': 'Kid Friendly', 'slug': 'kid-friendly'}, {'name': 'Weekend Meal Prep', 'slug': 'meal-prep'}, {'name': 'Romantic Dinners', 'slug': 'romantic-dinners'}, {'name': 'Dinner', 'slug': 'dinner'}, {'name': 'Pasta', 'slug': 'pasta'}, {'name': 'Italian', 'slug': 'italian'}], 'total_time_minutes': 55, 'total_time_tier': {'display_tier': 'Under 1 hour', 'tier': 'under_1_hour'}, 'updated_at': 1683237600, 'user_ratings': {'count_negative': 9, 'count_positive': 227, 'score': 0.961864406779661}, 'video_ad_content': 'none', 'video_id': 11953, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/23970/low_1487114404.m3u8', 'yields': 'Servings: 7-8 (makes 26 meatballs)'}, {'approved_at': 1506050519, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'brand': None, 'brand_id': None, 'buzz_id': 4636089, 'canonical_id': 'recipe:2662', 'compilations': [{'approved_at': 1506302942, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/video-api-prod/assets/69046c536f7d40eabffca45ad3517f46/BFV28873_6MicrowaveMeals-Beauty.jpg', 'buzz_id': 4636197, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:209', 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1505929760, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 209, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'und', 'name': '7 Dorm-Friendly Microwave Meals', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': '7-dorm-friendly-microwave-meals', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/101485.jpg', 'video_id': 30035, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/52822/low_1505933071.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1541638373, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:731', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1541552144, 'description': None, 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 731, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Quick & Healthy Microwave Snacks', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'quick-healthy-microwave-snacks', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/187640.jpg', 'video_id': 70463, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/114534/hls24_1541555144.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1600954883, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:1694', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1599565312, 'description': 'Hungry but too lazy to cook? These super easy microwave snacks will keep all your hunger pangs at bay. From customizable <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/10-minute-baked-potato\">Baked Potato</a> to <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-chocolate-lava-cake\">Chocolate Lava Cake</a>, you can whip up these mouthwatering (and fool-proof!) snacks in no time. So turn on your microwave, sit back, relax — and watch the magic happen.', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 1694, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Quick Microwavable Recipes To Keep You From Procrastinating', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'quick-microwavable-recipes-to-keep-you-from-procrastinating', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/281957.jpg', 'video_id': 113036, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/178243/hls24_1599565945.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1624289003, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2479', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1622205572, 'description': 'Feelin\\' a bit lazy today? We have just the right meal plan for you using only your microwave! For breakfast we recommend this easy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwaved-egg-breakfast-sandwich\">Microwaved Egg Breakfast Sandwich.</a> Then step up your game with a 2-course meal for lunch. Start off with this easy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/10-minute-baked-potato\">10-minute baked potato</a> and serve it along with some microwaved <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwaved-caprese-pita-pizza\">caprese pita pizza.</a> For a slightly fancy and healthy dinner, check out this<a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-spaghetti-squash-meatballs\">Microwave Spaghetti Squash Meatballs.</a> And finish up with this super easy <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/5-minute-microwave-cheesecake\">5-minute Microwave Cheesecake.</a> Let\\'s take it easy, shall we?', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2479, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'How To Cook Using JUST Your Microwave!', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'how-to-cook-using-just-your-microwave', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/324422.jpg', 'video_id': 132629, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/204394/hls24_1622205616.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1633532762, 'aspect_ratio': None, 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:2854', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1632482138, 'description': 'You should be taking advantage of your microwave, especially when you\\'re pressed for time in the kitchen! With this little appliance, you can whip up a divine mac and cheese or a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-10-minute-loaded-potato\">10-minute baked potato</a> with almost no effort. Have friends popping by at the last-minute? Throw together a quick plate of <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-4-minute-bbq-chicken-nachos\">four-minute BBQ chicken nachos</a>. Let\\'s hear it for this exceptionally speedy kitchen appliance. ', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2854, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': 'Microwave Meals For Those You Avoid Cooking', 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'microwave-meals-for-those-you-avoid-cooking', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://s3.amazonaws.com/video-api-prod/assets/bc8fa1c0d435498cb11915d27ac61e96/fb1.jpg', 'video_id': 142188, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/217146/hls24_1632482812.m3u8'}, {'approved_at': 1683142781, 'aspect_ratio': '1:1', 'beauty_url': None, 'buzz_id': None, 'canonical_id': 'compilation:3563', 'country': 'US', 'created_at': 1682313571, 'description': 'Thank goodness for microwaves! When you\\'re short on time to cook or running low on fresh groceries, the microwave definitely comes handy! Try these quick dishes, like a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-10-minute-loaded-potato\">10-Minute Loaded Potato</a>, <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/chicken-rice-bean-burritos\">Chicken, Rice & Bean Burritos</a>, or <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/microwave-spaghetti-squash-meatballs\">Spaghetti Squash & Meatballs!</a> These microwave recipes are gonna make your life so much easier!', 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 3563, 'is_shoppable': False, 'keywords': None, 'language': 'eng', 'name': \"8 Microwave-Friendly Dinners (When You're Running Low On Groceries)\", 'promotion': 'full', 'show': [{'id': 17, 'name': 'Tasty'}], 'slug': 'easy-microwave-recipes', 'thumbnail_alt_text': '', 'thumbnail_url': 'https://img.buzzfeed.com/thumbnailer-prod-us-east-1/video-api/assets/442372.jpg', 'video_id': 190215, 'video_url': 'https://vid.tasty.co/output/285661/hls24_1682313557.m3u8'}], 'cook_time_minutes': 20, 'country': 'ZZ', 'created_at': 1505929763, 'credits': [{'is_verified': False, 'name': 'Alvin Zhou', 'picture_url': '', 'type': 'internal', 'user_id': None}], 'description': \"Say hello to a quick and delicious meal with this Microwave Spaghetti Squash & Meatballs recipe! You'll be savoring every bite of this wholesome dish that's perfect for busy weeknights and cozy weekends alike.\", 'draft_status': 'published', 'facebook_posts': [], 'id': 2662, 'inspired_by_url': None, 'instructions': [{'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Slice the spaghetti squash in half. If you’re having difficult, poke some holes with a knife, then microwave for 5 minutes.', 'end_time': 144860, 'id': 21863, 'position': 1, 'start_time': 141416, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Scoop out the seeds and innards with a spoon, then rub oil, salt, and pepper all over the surface.', 'end_time': 155359, 'id': 21864, 'position': 2, 'start_time': 145410, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Microwave for about 10-15 minutes until the squash is tender and pulls away from the skin easily.', 'end_time': 0, 'id': 21865, 'position': 3, 'start_time': 0, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Using a fork, shred the squash into noodle-like strands.', 'end_time': 165850, 'id': 21866, 'position': 4, 'start_time': 160770, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Microwave the meatballs with the pasta sauce, covered, for about 2 minutes or until the meatballs are fully heated through.', 'end_time': 173580, 'id': 21867, 'position': 5, 'start_time': 167430, 'temperature': None}, {'appliance': None, 'display_text': 'Spoon the meatballs and sauce on top of each spaghett